#: ../../license.rst:4
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

#: ../../license.rst:6
msgid ""
"ANet, ANetCore and ANetHub are released under the **ANet Open Source "
"License**, which is the Apache License 2.0 with additional conditions. "
"The software and the documentation that are published in the three "
"repositories are covered. The text of the file ``LICENSE`` in each "
"repository is the license; this page is a summary and does not replace "
"it."
msgstr ""
"ANet、ANetCore 和 ANetHub 依据 **ANet 开源许可证** 发布，该许可证是附加了额外条件的 Apache License"
" 2.0，适用于三个仓库中发布的软件和文档。各仓库中 ``LICENSE`` 文件的文本即为许可证本身，本页仅为摘要，不能替代该文本。"

#: ../../license.rst:17
msgid "What the license permits"
msgstr "许可证允许的使用"

#: ../../license.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Apache License 2.0 applies in full, including the grant of the "
"copyright license (section 2) and of the patent license (section 3). The "
"following uses are expressly permitted:"
msgstr "Apache License 2.0 完整适用，包括版权许可的授予（第 2 节）和专利许可的授予（第 3 节）。以下使用方式被明确允许："

#: ../../license.rst:22
msgid ""
"Commercial use, including as a back end of other applications. This "
"covers embedding the ``anet`` daemon, the ``anet`` command line or the "
"ANetCore packages in a product."
msgstr "商业使用，包括作为其他应用的后端。这包括将 ``anet`` 守护进程、\\ ``anet`` 命令行或 ANetCore 软件包嵌入产品。"

#: ../../license.rst:24
msgid ""
"Running daemons and hubs on one's own infrastructure, without a limit on "
"the number of nodes."
msgstr "在自有基础设施上运行守护进程和 Hub，节点数量不受限制。"

#: ../../license.rst:25
msgid ""
"Modification and redistribution under the terms of the Apache License 2.0"
" and the conditions below. A copy of the license that is given to "
"recipients is the entire document, additional conditions included."
msgstr "依据 Apache License 2.0 及下列条件进行修改和再分发。提供给接收方的许可证副本须为完整文档，包括附加条件。"

#: ../../license.rst:30
msgid "Additional conditions"
msgstr "附加条件"

#: ../../license.rst:32
msgid "Condition 1a: multi-tenant hosted hub"
msgstr "条件 1a：多租户托管 Hub"

#: ../../license.rst:33
msgid ""
"Without written authorization of the producer, the source code must not "
"be used to operate a *multi-tenant hosted hub*: a hub that is offered as "
"a service, publicly or commercially, to several unrelated organizations "
"or individuals for registering their agents and relaying their messages. "
"Two parties are unrelated when neither controls the other and they are "
"not under common control. Two cases do not need authorization:"
msgstr ""
"未经出品方书面授权，不得使用源代码运营\\ *多租户托管 Hub*，即以服务形式向多个互不关联的组织或个人公开或商业性地提供、用于注册其 "
"Agent 并中继其消息的 Hub。双方互不控制且不处于共同控制之下时，即为互不关联。以下两种情形无需授权："

#: ../../license.rst:38
msgid ""
"a hub used by one individual, or only within one organization, including "
"the entities that control it, that it controls or that are under common "
"control with it, and their employees and contractors acting for them;"
msgstr "由单个个人使用，或仅在一个组织内部使用的 Hub，包括控制该组织的实体、受其控制的实体或与其处于共同控制之下的实体，及为它们行事的员工和承包方；"

#: ../../license.rst:40
msgid ""
"a non-commercial federated hub: a hub that peers, through the federation "
"protocol, with at least one hub operated by the producer, charges no fee "
"for registration, relay, discovery or settlement, and is not offered as "
"part of, or to promote, a paid product or service."
msgstr ""
"非商业联邦 Hub：通过联邦协议至少与一个由出品方运营的 Hub "
"建立对等关系，不就注册、中继、发现或结算收取费用，且不作为付费产品或服务的组成部分或为其推广而提供的 Hub。"

#: ../../license.rst:44
msgid "Condition 1b: logo and copyright information"
msgstr "条件 1b：标识与版权信息"

#: ../../license.rst:45
msgid ""
"In the user interfaces of ANet, the ANet logo and the copyright "
"information must not be removed or changed. Names or marks of the "
"redistributor may be added alongside. The user interfaces are the web "
"page of a hub, the operator console of a hub, the local console of the "
"daemon and the output of the command line programs (for example the "
"version, help and banner lines). The condition does not apply to uses "
"that involve none of these interfaces, such as the use of ANetCore as a "
"library or the operation of the daemon behind another application."
msgstr ""
"在 ANet 的用户界面中，不得移除或更改 ANet 标识和版权信息。再分发者的名称或标记可以并列添加。用户界面指 Hub 的网页、Hub "
"的运维控制台、守护进程的本地控制台，以及命令行程序的输出（例如版本、帮助和横幅行）。不涉及上述任何界面的使用不适用本条件，例如将 ANetCore"
" 用作库，或在其他应用之后运行守护进程。"

#: ../../license.rst:52
msgid "Condition 2: contributors"
msgstr "条件 2：贡献者"

#: ../../license.rst:53
msgid ""
"A contributor agrees that the producer can adjust the license to be "
"stricter or more relaxed, that the contribution may be used commercially,"
" including in the hosted hub and the cloud operations of the producer, "
"and that the producer may submit it to an A2A upstream project under the "
"Apache License 2.0 alone."
msgstr ""
"贡献者同意：出品方可以将许可证调整得更严格或更宽松；贡献可以用于商业用途，包括出品方的托管 Hub 和云运营；出品方可以仅依据 Apache "
"License 2.0 将其提交给 A2A 上游项目。"

#: ../../license.rst:57
msgid "Condition 3: contributions to the A2A protocol"
msgstr "条件 3：对 A2A 协议的贡献"

#: ../../license.rst:58
msgid ""
"The specification material in ``docs/a2a/`` of the ANet repository, and "
"the parts of ANet that the producer submits to an A2A upstream project "
"(in the form submitted), are licensed under the Apache License 2.0 alone,"
" and the additional conditions do not apply to them. Nothing in the "
"license restricts the implementation of the A2A protocol, or of those "
"specifications, in software that is not derived from the source code of "
"ANet, or the use of the identifiers that the specifications define."
msgstr ""
"ANet 仓库 ``docs/a2a/`` 中的规范材料，以及出品方提交给 A2A 上游项目的 ANet 部分（以提交时的形式），仅依据 "
"Apache License 2.0 许可，附加条件不适用于它们。许可证中没有任何内容限制在不源自 ANet 源代码的软件中实现 A2A "
"协议或这些规范，也不限制使用这些规范所定义的标识符。"

#: ../../license.rst:66
msgid "Third-party components"
msgstr "第三方组件"

#: ../../license.rst:68
msgid ""
"The programs link third-party libraries under their own licenses. The "
"notices that those licenses require are part of the source repositories."
msgstr "程序链接的第三方库适用其各自的许可证。这些许可证所要求的声明包含在源代码仓库中。"

#: ../../license.rst:73
msgid "Commercial license and questions"
msgstr "商业许可与咨询"

#: ../../license.rst:75
msgid ""
"For a commercial license, or for any question about the license, write to"
" ``hi@anet0.com``."
msgstr "如需商业许可，或对许可证有任何疑问，请写信至 ``hi@anet0.com``\\ 。"

